# Web application OAuth client ID for Brave Google Drive sync fallback (gglcloud project).
# Copy this file to drive-oauth-web-client-id.local (gitignored) and replace the line below.
#
# Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials
# → Create credentials → OAuth client ID → Application type: Web application
# Add the exact chrome.identity.getRedirectURL("drive") URI shown for each
# runtime that intentionally enables Brave fallback.
#
# Do NOT paste or store client_secret values.
REPLACE_WITH_OPTIONAL_WEB_APPLICATION_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com
